ider"},{"type":"text","text":"), opacities (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and dimensions (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"title":"BlueCoatThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misothemesmisobluecoat\/bluecoatthemelistitemcomponenttokensprovider","role":"symbol"}}}